  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The safest idea is, keep one untouched copy of the original matrix.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 5240,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 157,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Think of it as our source of truth.",
      "start_ms": 5720,
      "end_ms": 8020,
      "start_frame": 172,
      "end_frame": 241,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "We read zero information only from this original copy, and we write changes only into the working matrix.",
      "start_ms": 8840,
      "end_ms": 16140,
      "start_frame": 265,
      "end_frame": 484,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "Now trace it.",
      "start_ms": 16680,
      "end_ms": 17640,
      "start_frame": 500,
      "end_frame": 529,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "In the original copy, our first zero is at row zero, column two, because this zero belongs to the original input.",
      "start_ms": 18280,
      "end_ms": 26080,
      "start_frame": 548,
      "end_frame": 782,
      "word_count": 21
    },
    {
      "text": "Zero, row zero in the working matrix, then zero, column two.",
      "start_ms": 27100,
      "end_ms": 32100,
      "start_frame": 813,
      "end_frame": 963,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "The working matrix changes, but the source copy does not.",
      "start_ms": 32940,
      "end_ms": 36720,
      "start_frame": 988,
      "end_frame": 1102,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue through the original copy.",
      "start_ms": 37120,
      "end_ms": 38880,
      "start_frame": 1114,
      "end_frame": 1166,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "The next original zero is at row two, column zero.",
      "start_ms": 39560,
      "end_ms": 43180,
      "start_frame": 1187,
      "end_frame": 1295,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "So zero, row two in the working matrix, and zero, column zero.",
      "start_ms": 43580,
      "end_ms": 48080,
      "start_frame": 1307,
      "end_frame": 1442,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Again, the source copy stays untouched.",
      "start_ms": 48480,
      "end_ms": 52280,
      "start_frame": 1454,
      "end_frame": 1568,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Then we reach the original zero at row three, column three.",
      "start_ms": 52620,
      "end_ms": 56320,
      "start_frame": 1579,
      "end_frame": 1690,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Zero, row three, and zero, column three in the working matrix.",
      "start_ms": 56900,
      "end_ms": 61900,
      "start_frame": 1707,
      "end_frame": 1857,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Now all three original zero sources have been processed.",
      "start_ms": 62580,
      "end_ms": 66220,
      "start_frame": 1877,
      "end_frame": 1987,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Notice what we never did.",
      "start_ms": 66740,
      "end_ms": 68160,
      "start_frame": 2002,
      "end_frame": 2045,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "We never created inside the working matrix as a new source.",
      "start_ms": 68600,
      "end_ms": 73700,
      "start_frame": 2058,
      "end_frame": 2211,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Every zeroing decision came from the untouched original copy.",
      "start_ms": 74680,
      "end_ms": 78340,
      "start_frame": 2240,
      "end_frame": 2350,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "So newly created zeros cannot create a false chain reaction.",
      "start_ms": 78980,
      "end_ms": 83160,
      "start_frame": 2369,
      "end_frame": 2495,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "After all three original zeros are processed, the result becomes 00000 0700 10 00000 00000 02200 25.",
      "start_ms": 83860,
      "end_ms": 102560,
      "start_frame": 2516,
      "end_frame": 3077,
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "So method one works, but we paid for that safety by storing the whole matrix again.",
      "start_ms": 103460,
      "end_ms": 109500,
      "start_frame": 3104,
      "end_frame": 3285,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's write the idea in code.",
      "start_ms": 109500,
      "end_ms": 111900,
      "start_frame": 3285,
      "end_frame": 3357,
      "word_count": 6
    }
  ],
